OL,3,GNEWSAChildren taken to hospital after
OL,4,Achemical fumes at Dublin pool
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Dublin Fire Brigade (DFB)'s chief
OL,7,Ffire officer Greg O'Dwyer told RTE the
OL,8,Fincident was caused by "overmixing" of
OL,9,Fchlorine and another chemical in the
OL,10,Fpool's plant room.
